# Keep images small and builds reproducible: nothing here is needed to build an app image.
.git/
.github/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
dist/
**/dist/
.next/
**/.next/
coverage/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
# The end-to-end suite runs from the host against the images; the app's tsconfig would otherwise type-check it in the build.
**/e2e/
**/playwright.config.ts
.local/
docs/
*.md
.eslintcache
.DS_Store
